Remove a reservation or pool

Usage:
  olr dhcp rm [command]

Available Commands:
  pool        Remove an interface's pool
  reservation Remove a reservation

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for rm

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr dhcp rm [command] --help" for more information about a command.
